WEBVTT

NOTE
One fibre — Loom Display. The film carries these captions in frame; this track
is the same text as a selectable, resizable alternative.

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:05.600
A letter is a stroke that has been asked to hold a shape.

2
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:15.600
This is one fibre: 84 units wide, on a thousand-unit em.
It does not get heavier at the bottom, because it is not carrying anything.

3
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:26.600
A circle is exponent two. A squircle is four.
This is 2.55, so the curve remembers being pulled.

4
00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:37.600
Where two straight strokes meet, the corner is cut flat.
Bevel, never miter. A letter here is fabricated, not grown.

5
00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:51.600
Twenty-six of those decisions, then the figures,
then the eighteen marks a headline needs.

6
00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:59.200
The name, set in the face that was drawn for it.

7
00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:07.000
Loom Display. Drawn for Woodhouse, 11 November 2026.
